---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const root=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Qualification and evidence" description="Deterministic synthetic qualification, traceability and technical evidence workflows in HealthQualify." active="qualification">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> EVIDENCE-FIRST ENGINEERING</div><h1>Evidence you can follow.<br/><em>Outcomes you can reproduce.</em></h1><p class="lead">Link requirements to predefined synthetic qualification checks, inspect deviations, and replay technical evidence. No model-generated PASS/FAIL.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="button primary" href={root+'docs/USER_GUIDE/'}>Explore qualification ↗</a><a class="button ghost" href={root+'docs/VERIFICATION_GUIDE/'}>Verify evidence →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section light"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><span class="kicker">THE QUALIFICATION PATH</span><h2>Structured from requirement to result.</h2></div><div class="steps-grid"><div class="step-card"><span>01</span><h3>Requirement</h3><p>Document acceptance basis and risk.</p></div><div class="step-card"><span>02</span><h3>Test</h3><p>Link IQ/OQ/PQ checks to requirements.</p></div><div class="step-card"><span>03</span><h3>Run</h3><p>Record PASS, FAIL, ERROR or NOT_RUN.</p></div><div class="step-card"><span>04</span><h3>Evidence</h3><p>Inspect manifests, trace links and draft review.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section pale"><div class="container compact"><span class="kicker">SYNTHETIC WALKTHROUGH</span><h2>Two passes. Five intentionally seeded failures.</h2><p>This demonstration explains how a quality engineering workflow surfaces known defects. It is not a regulated validation or medical-device qualification decision.</p><a class="text-link" href={root+'docs/END_TO_END_WORKFLOW/'}>Walk through the example ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
